ser Dave.","zh":"用户戴夫，这个纪元以其不寻常的生命形式而闻名。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"I know! Gymnosperms, right?","zh":"我懂了！裸子植物，对不对？"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I was thinking more in terms of saurians, User Dave. Dinosaurs.","zh":"用户戴夫，我更多是在指蜥形纲动物。恐龙。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"They won't attack us directly and we can't affect them.","zh":"它们不会直接攻击我们，我们也没办法干涉它们。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"However, they will definitely react to zombies. Be wary!","zh":"但是，它们肯定会对僵尸有所反应。多加小心！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"}]},"ui":{}}
